CircleShootApp
--------------
The game logic in js/ is a line-by-line JavaScript port based on the decompilation project
CircleShootApp (https://github.com/alula/CircleShootApp). Its README states that the decompiled game source
is provided as-is and that modifications are licensed under MIT.

